// Pricing: a section of plans a person compares and picks, as cards in one row. What it is: a centred head (the
// section's title and one lead line), then the plans (shape Plan), each a card that reads top to bottom in one
// order — the plan's name (with a small tag on the featured one), its price large with its period beside it in the
// muted ink, the line that says who it is for, its points as a list of rows each led by a drawn tick, and its one
// action at the card's foot. The feet line up across the row (a spacer takes the slack), so the three actions
// read as one line on a desktop. The featured plan is raised: the raised ground, an accent edge drawn
// twice as heavy (a ring outside its hairline, so its words keep the other cards' grid) and its tag — the edge,
// not the fill, carries it, since a theme may give page and surface one colour — and its action is the section's
// one filled control. Every other plan's action is plain.
//
// Width, with no breakpoint (Exact has no media query): the cards share a wrapping row, each flex=1 from a named
// least width (blocks.plan-min) up to a named most (blocks.plan-max), border-box, centred; the section caps at
// blocks.pricing-max. Three fit across on a desktop; on a phone each takes its own line, full width; a lone plan
// stands centred at the most width rather than stretching into a slab.
//
// States, declared once:
// - data many|one|empty|loading|failed|long. Loading keeps the head (the section's name is known; the plans are
//   not), says `loadingText` as a status line where the lead stood, and stands three breathing ghost cards in the
//   cards' own geometry — each bar in a row its line's own height: name, price, line, four points, the action — so
//   nothing moves when the plans arrive. Empty and failed are the kit's StatePanel in the cards' place: empty says `emptyTitle` and
//   `emptyText` with the way on (`contactLabel`, which reaches `contact`); failed says `failedTitle` and
//   `failedText` with `retryLabel`, which reaches `retry`. Long text wraps inside each card; nothing truncates.
// - interaction idle|busy: the chosen plan's action (`chosenKey`) keeps its words, is busy and cannot be pressed.
// - outcome none|success|error: one line under the chosen plan's action, `outcomeText` in the outcome's ink on the
//   card's own ground (status words never sit on a tint).
// - agent none|proposed|changed|waiting, always about the chosen plan: its card's foot holds the agent's act in
//   place of its action — the kit's Proposal look drawn small (a box edged in the act's ink, accent for proposed
//   and changed, caution while waiting, on the card's own ground), one sentence beside a dot of that ink, then its
//   answers. Proposed: `proposalText`, `rejectLabel` plain and `acceptLabel` filled; changed: `changedText` and
//   `undoLabel`, a plain button that reaches `undo` (the plan is already the person's, so its own action would
//   say nothing); waiting: `waitingText`, then the plan's own action, filled, for the person to take. While the
//   agent asks or waits, its answer is the state's one filled control and the featured action steps down to plain.
// Both doors reach the same actions: a plan's button calls `choose` with the plan's key, as an agent's tool does.
// The kit's Proposal and EntryChoice live inline in this package's index.contract, which imports this file back,
// so a plan card and the ask are drawn here from the same components (Words, ActionButton); StatePanel has its
// own file and is used as it is. A lone plan's action is filled: it is the section's way on. Every word is the
// app's; every value a Theme token or a blocks.* size.
use Words, ActionButton from "__SCOPE__/components"
use StatePanel from "./state-panel.contract"

// One plan: its key, its name, its price and the period that price is for ("" for none), the line that says who
// it is for, what it includes, whether it is the plan the app recommends, and the words of its one action.
shape Plan
  key: string
  name: string
  price: string
  period: string
  detail: string
  points: string[]
  featured: bool
  action: string

// The ghost cards breathe, so loading reads as in progress, not as drawn shapes.
keyframes plan-breathe
  50% opacity=0.55

// The ink of an agent's mark: the accent for an ask or a change, caution while it waits for the person.
fn markInk(a: string): string = a == "waiting" ? "theme.color.caution" : "theme.color.accent"
fn markWords(a: string): string = a == "waiting" ? "theme.color.caution-text" : "theme.color.accent"

// The featured plan's tag: a few words in the accent on the card's own ground, a hairline of the same ink. The
// kit's Tag draws a pill, whose round ends bulge once its words wrap; this keeps the control's corner so a long
// tag holds as a small box.
component PlanTag
  props
    text: string
  view
    text text min-width=0 font="theme.type.caption" color="theme.color.accent" padding-left="theme.space.sm" padding-right="theme.space.sm" padding-top="theme.space.xs" padding-bottom="theme.space.xs" border-radius="theme.radius.control" border-width="theme.line.width" border-style="solid" border-color="theme.color.accent"

// Every card's name row holds the tag's height (blocks.plan-head), tagged or not, so the prices across the row
// share one line.

// One point a plan includes: a drawn tick, then its words, which wrap under themselves.
component PlanPoint
  props
    text: string
  view
    row role="listitem" align-items="flex-start" gap="theme.space.sm"
      row min-height="blocks.point-line" align-items="center" flex-shrink=0 aria-hidden=true
        svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" width="blocks.point-tick" height="blocks.point-tick" fill="none" stroke="theme.color.accent"
          path d="M2.5 6.5L5 9l4.5-5" stroke-width=1.75 stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"
      text text flex=1 min-width=0 font="theme.type.body" color="theme.color.ink"

// One bar of a ghost card: `share` of its line against `rest`, `height` tall, centred in a row as tall as the
// line of words it stands for (`line`), so a ghost card stands exactly as tall as the card that replaces it.
component GhostBar
  props
    share: string
    rest: string
    height: string
    line: string
  view
    row min-height=line align-items="center"
      box flex=share height=height background-color="theme.color.fill" border-radius="theme.radius.pill"
      box flex=rest

// A plan that has not arrived: the card's own frame, gaps and line heights — the name row, the price, the line,
// four points, the action — breathing, never a control.
component GhostPlan
  view
    column flex=1 min-width="blocks.plan-min" max-width="blocks.plan-max" box-sizing="border-box" gap="theme.space.lg" padding="theme.space.xl" background-color="theme.color.surface" border-radius="theme.radius.card" border-width="theme.line.width" border-style="solid" border-color="theme.color.line" aria-hidden=true animation="plan-breathe 1.8s ease-in-out infinite"
      column gap="theme.space.sm"
        GhostBar(share="1 1 0", rest="2 1 0", height="blocks.ghost-line", line="blocks.plan-head")
        GhostBar(share="1 1 0", rest="1 1 0", height="blocks.ghost-price", line="blocks.price-line")
        GhostBar(share="4 1 0", rest="1 1 0", height="blocks.ghost-line", line="blocks.caption-line")
      column gap="theme.space.sm"
        GhostBar(share="3 1 0", rest="1 1 0", height="blocks.ghost-line", line="blocks.point-line")
        GhostBar(share="2 1 0", rest="1 1 0", height="blocks.ghost-line", line="blocks.point-line")
        GhostBar(share="3 1 0", rest="2 1 0", height="blocks.ghost-line", line="blocks.point-line")
        GhostBar(share="2 1 0", rest="2 1 0", height="blocks.ghost-line", line="blocks.point-line")
      box height="blocks.action-min" margin-top="theme.space.lg" background-color="theme.color.fill" border-radius="theme.radius.control"

component Pricing
  props
    title: string
    lead: string
    plans: Plan[]
    tagLabel: string
    chosenKey: string
    loadingText: string
    emptyTitle: string
    emptyText: string
    contactLabel: string
    failedTitle: string
    failedText: string
    retryLabel: string
    outcomeText: string
    proposalText: string
    acceptLabel: string
    rejectLabel: string
    changedText: string
    undoLabel: string
    waitingText: string
    data: enum<"many", "one", "empty", "loading", "failed", "long">
    interaction: enum<"idle", "busy">
    outcome: enum<"none", "success", "error">
    agent: enum<"none", "proposed", "changed", "waiting">
    choose: action
    contact: action
    retry: action
    accept: action
    reject: action
    undo: action
    testId: string
  derive lone = plans.length == 1
  // While the agent asks or waits for the person, its answer is the section's one filled control.
  derive asks = agent == "proposed" or agent == "waiting"
  // One door for the person's press; an agent's tool calls the app's same `choose` with the same key.
  action pick(key: string)
    choose(key)
  // The state panel's one way on: back to the plans when they failed, else to a person who can set one up.
  action wayOn
    if data == "failed"
      retry()
    else
      contact()
  view
    column testId=testId role="region" aria-label=title width="100%" max-width="blocks.pricing-max" box-sizing="border-box" margin-left="auto" margin-right="auto" gap="theme.space.xl"
      column align-items="center" text-align="center" gap="theme.space.sm" padding-left="theme.space.lg" padding-right="theme.space.lg"
        Words(text=title, kind="title", outcome="none", level=2, testId=`${testId}-title`)
        if data == "loading"
          text loadingText testId=`${testId}-loading` role="status" font="theme.type.body" color="theme.color.ink-muted"
        else if lead != ""
          text lead testId=`${testId}-lead` max-width="blocks.lead-max" font="theme.type.body" color="theme.color.ink-muted"
      if data == "loading"
        row flex-wrap="wrap" justify-content="center" gap="theme.space.lg"
          GhostPlan()
          GhostPlan()
          GhostPlan()
      else if data == "empty" or data == "failed" or plans.length == 0
        StatePanel(title=(data == "failed" ? failedTitle : emptyTitle), message=emptyText, failedText=failedText, agentNote="", actionLabel=contactLabel, retryLabel=retryLabel, data=(data == "failed" ? "failed" : "empty"), agent="none", size="full", press=wayOn, testId=`${testId}-state`)
      else
        row role="list" flex-wrap="wrap" justify-content="center" align-items="stretch" gap="theme.space.lg"
          for p in plans key=p.key
            column role="listitem" testId=`${testId}-plan-${p.key}` aria-label=p.name flex=1 min-width="blocks.plan-min" max-width="blocks.plan-max" box-sizing="border-box" gap="theme.space.lg" padding="theme.space.xl" background-color=(p.featured ? "theme.color.raised" : "theme.color.surface") border-radius="theme.radius.card" border-width="theme.line.width" border-style="solid" border-color=(p.featured ? "theme.color.accent" : "theme.color.line") box-shadow=(p.featured ? "0 0 0 1px theme.color.accent" : "none")
              column gap="theme.space.sm"
                row flex-wrap="wrap" align-items="center" min-height="blocks.plan-head" column-gap="theme.space.sm" row-gap="theme.space.xs"
                  text p.name testId=`${testId}-name-${p.key}` role="heading" aria-level=3 flex=1 min-width=0 font="theme.type.label" color="theme.color.ink"
                  if p.featured and tagLabel != ""
                    PlanTag(text=tagLabel)
                row flex-wrap="wrap" align-items="baseline" column-gap="theme.space.xs" row-gap="theme.space.xs"
                  text p.price testId=`${testId}-price-${p.key}` min-width=0 font="theme.type.title" color="theme.color.ink" font-variant-numeric="tabular-nums"
                  if p.period != ""
                    text p.period min-width=0 font="theme.type.caption" color="theme.color.ink-muted"
                if p.detail != ""
                  text p.detail min-width=0 font="theme.type.caption" color="theme.color.ink-muted"
              if p.points.length > 0
                column role="list" gap="theme.space.sm"
                  for pt, i in p.points key=i
                    PlanPoint(text=pt)
              column flex=1
              column gap="theme.space.md"
                if p.key == chosenKey and agent != "none"
                  // The agent's act on this plan, the kit's Proposal look inside the card: one sentence beside a dot
                  // of its ink, then its answers in place of the plan's action.
                  column testId=`${testId}-agent` role="status" gap="theme.space.md" padding="theme.space.md" border-radius="theme.radius.control" border-width="theme.line.width" border-style="solid" border-color=markInk(agent) background-color="theme.color.surface"
                    row align-items="baseline" gap="theme.space.sm"
                      box width="blocks.agent-dot" height="blocks.agent-dot" flex-shrink=0 border-radius="theme.radius.pill" background-color=markInk(agent) aria-hidden=true
                      text (agent == "proposed" ? proposalText : agent == "changed" ? changedText : waitingText) testId=`${testId}-agent-text` flex=1 min-width=0 font="theme.type.caption" color=markWords(agent)
                    if agent == "proposed"
                      row flex-wrap="wrap" gap="theme.space.sm"
                        column flex=1
                          ActionButton(label=rejectLabel, kind="plain", interaction="idle", outcome="none", press=reject, testId=`${testId}-reject`)
                        column flex=1
                          ActionButton(label=acceptLabel, kind="primary", interaction="idle", outcome="none", press=accept, testId=`${testId}-accept`)
                    else if agent == "changed"
                      ActionButton(label=undoLabel, kind="plain", interaction="idle", outcome="none", press=undo, testId=`${testId}-undo`)
                    else
                      ActionButton(label=p.action, kind="primary", interaction=(interaction == "busy" ? "busy" : "idle"), outcome="none", press=pick(p.key), testId=`${testId}-choose-${p.key}`)
                else
                  ActionButton(label=p.action, kind=((p.featured or lone) and not asks ? "primary" : "plain"), interaction=(p.key == chosenKey and interaction == "busy" ? "busy" : "idle"), outcome="none", press=pick(p.key), testId=`${testId}-choose-${p.key}`)
                if p.key == chosenKey and outcome != "none"
                  text outcomeText testId=`${testId}-outcome` role=(outcome == "error" ? "alert" : "status") font="theme.type.caption" color=(outcome == "error" ? "theme.color.critical-text" : "theme.color.positive-text")
